e exactly one PR comment.\\n\\nContext of the failure itself\\nThe session failed with Codex emitted error event: Incomplete response returned, reason: max_output_tokens. The last tool activity was at about 16:50Z; a stream reconnect followed at 17:36Z and turn.failed at 18:18:53Z. The failure log is linked from the first comment above. Nothing was lost: every file change the session made had been committed and pushed before it failed (last push: commit 3715ba8). The truncation itself looks like #4079 (the same max_output_tokens ending after a long single Codex turn). This issue is only about the duplicate stop comment.ActivitySign up for free to join this conversation on GitHub. Already have an account? Sign in to commentMetadataMetadataAssigneesNo one assignedLabelsNo labelsNo labelsTypeNo typeProjectsNo projectsMilestoneNo milestoneRelationshipsNone yetDevelopmentNo branches or pull requestsIssue actionsOpen in GitHub Copilot app\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n    \\n  \\n\\n  \\n\\n  \\n            \\n  Footer\\n\\n  \\n\\n\\n  \\n    \\n      \\n        \\n    \\n\\n\\n      \\n        &copy; 2026 GitHub,&nbsp;Inc.\\n      \\n    \\n\\n    \\n      Footer navigation\\n\\n      \\n\\n\\n          \\n            Terms\\n          \\n\\n          \\n            Privacy\\n          \\n\\n\\n            \\n              Security\\n            \\n\\n            \\n              Status\\n            \\n\\n          \\n            Community\\n          \\n\\n          \\n            Docs\\n          \\n\\n          \\n            Contact\\n          \\n\\n          \\n\\n  \\n    \\n      Manage cookies\\n    \\n  \\n\\n\\n  \\n    \\n      \\n        Do not share my personal information\\n      \\n    \\n  \\n\\n      \\n    \\n  \\n\\n\\n\\n\\n    \\n\\n\\n\\n\\n  \\n    \\n    \\n\\n    \\n      \\n    \\n\\n    \\n    You can’t perform that action at this time.\"},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":\"Let me open /tmp/gh-issue-solver-1794996928626/src/solve.auto